143	<div class="wrap">
144	  <header class="top">
145	    <div class="top-row">
146	      <h1>Maester PR Desk</h1>
147	      <span class="repo">maester365/maester · <span id="reviewed">waiting for reviews</span></span>
148	    </div>
149	    <ol class="steps">
150	      <li><b>1 · Claude reviews</b>Each open PR gets a verdict, findings and a draft comment.</li>
151	      <li class="now"><b>2 · You decide</b>Edit the comment, pick fixes we make ourselves, then queue it.</li>
152	      <li><b>3 · Claude acts</b>Posts the review, pushes fixes, merges, and logs the outcome here.</li>
153	    </ol>
154	    <div class="process">When you're done, tell Claude <kbd>process the PR desk</kbd><span id="queuedNote"></span></div>
155	  </header>
156	
157	  <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter pull requests" id="tabs"></nav>
158	
159	  <div id="notice" class="notice">Loading pull requests…</div>
160	  <div class="list" id="list"></div>
161	
162	  <footer>Only you and editors can change decisions. Claude reads queued decisions when you ask it to process the desk; nothing is posted from this page directly.</footer>
163	</div>
